  stmt_return_err_value.pcpp - break step of stmt_return.pcpp:
  return with a value in a procedure (SM0611)

  How to check, from repo\bin:
    pcpp res\tests\stmt_return_err_value.pcpp
    pcpp res\tests\stmt_return_err_value.pcpp -t x86_64-linux-gnu
  The marked line reports that code; nothing else is reported.
*******************************************************************************/

module exe stmt_return_err_value;

routine P();
begin
  return 1; // ERROR SM0611@10: return takes no value here
end;

begin
end.
